  "notes": "Input sockets are XLR/6.35 mm combo jacks (mic, line or instrument via the LINE/INST switch where present). USB bus-powered. Routing: inputs reach the outputs only with DIRECT MONITOR switched on. Controls from the U-PHORIA Quick Start Guide, 'Step 2: Controls'. LINE/INST and PAD are shown once per input, as on the front panel. Inputs reach the outputs only with DIRECT MONITOR on. Assumption: OUTPUT and PHONES at MIN are silent.",
